+    }
+
+    // Produced by Java `CommitMessageSerializer` v11 (Paimon 1.4.2) from
+    // `new CommitMessageImpl(BinaryRow.EMPTY_ROW, 3, null, empty, empty)`.
+    // This is the layout the Doris FE committer decodes, so it is pinned
